title: 주2_화_2교시_강의실_신아산_영문
---
<<play 공통_웅성>>
Prof: That's all for today's lecture.
{name()}: Ugh... finally over.
(I turn my head and see ASan packing her bags faster than anyone else.)
<<play san_sound>>
<<show san_idle>>
{name()}: Heading home already?
{name()}: Wait, what's that?
{name()}: ...Is that a guitar?
ASan: This?
ASan: Oh, did I not tell you?
<<show san_blush>>
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: I happen to be a lady of the bass..
<<show san_spec>>
<<wait 2>>
<<choice 주2_화_2교시_강의실_신아산_긍정1_영문 "It's my first time seeing a bass in person. It looks so cool." 주2_화_2교시_강의실_신아산_부정1_영문 "Don't people usually play electric guitar?" true>>
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: Well? Pretty awesome, right?
===

title: 주2_화_2교시_강의실_신아산_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: Whoa....
{name()}: It's my first time seeing a bass in person. It looks so cool.
<<show san_blush>>
<<change lvSan 5>>
<<like 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Right? Forget electric guitars or pianos, the bass is where the real soul is.
ASan: You actually have some taste, after all!
{name()}: Haha....
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: That's exactly why I signed up for this class.
<<choice 주2_화_2교시_강의실_신아산_긍정2_영문 "Yeah. A song popped into my head as soon as I heard the assignment details." 주2_화_2교시_강의실_신아산_부정2_영문 "Not yet...">>
ASan: The assignment is to submit a song review. Have you thought of a track yet?
===

title: 주2_화_2교시_강의실_신아산_부정1_영문
---
{name()}: The bass?
{name()}: Don't people usually play electric guitar instead?
<<show san_neg2>>
<<change lvSan -10>>
<<dislike 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: ELECTRIC GUITAR????????
ASan: Who plays something that tacky these days?????
ASan: Besides, the reason I play the bass is...
ASan: .....
ASan: Because my mom said I look the coolest when I'm playing it, okay!!!!!!!!!!!
(ASan huffs, swings her gig bag over her shoulder, and storms off into the distance.)
(I think I might have seen her eyes welling up with tears...)
<<notice "You feel a pang of guilt.">>
<<change karma +1>>
(What have I done...)
<<end>>
===

title: 주2_화_2교시_강의실_신아산_긍정2_영문
---
{name()}: Yeah. A song popped into my head as soon as I heard the assignment details.
ASan: What is it?
{name()}: "You Were Handsome" by Day-Five.
<<show san_smile>>
<<change lvSan 5>>
<<like 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Seriously???????
ASan: I am obsessed with Day-Five!
ASan: I've been a fan since their debut. I've been to their fan-signings, and I even have their vinyl records at home.
<<if get("lvSan") >= 30>>
    <<jump 주2_화_2교시_강의실_신아산_호감도_업_영문>>
