title: 주2_화_2교시_강의실_신아산_호감도_업_영문
---
<<show san_blush>>
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: Well, in that case... I can bring my Day-Five albums from home. Want to do the assignment together?
ASan: I mean, if you d-don't want to, you can say no.
ASan: ...................
<<show san_neg>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: You hate the idea, don't you?!!!!!!!
{name()}: Wh- No!!!!!!!!
{name()}: It's just my first time doing an assignment with someone else, so I was a bit caught off guard.
{name()}: Especially with a girl.
<<show san_shock>>
<<wait 1>>
<<show san_blush>>
<<change lvSan 5>>
<<like 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
{name()}: Anyway, I'd love to. Let's pick a day and work on it together.
ASan: Awesome!
ASan: S-s-so, see you then!!!!!
(ASan hurries off somewhere.)
(Was it just my imagination, or did she look incredibly happy as she rushed away?)
<<end>>
===

title: 주2_화_2교시_강의실_신아산_호감도_다운_영문
